1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,060
This free AI tool lets you clone any website

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:03,399
with just a single screenshot.

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,160
It's called Screenshot to Code,

4
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:06,940
and it's a fully open source project

5
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,019
with over 72,000 stars on GitHub.

6
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,380
You just drop in a screenshot and it'll read the layout,

7
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,119
the spacing, the fonts, the colors,

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,500
and even build the entire website for you live.

9
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:17,079
And it works on more than just screenshots.

10
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:19,120
You can give it a Figma design, reference images,

11
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,019
or even a screen recording of a site,

12
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,300
and it'll turn that thing

13
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,440
into a fully working prototype in minutes.

14
00:00:24,579 --> 00:00:26,039
Plus, you'll also get a live canvas,

15
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,019
so you can tweak anything however you want.

16
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:28,940
Wanna try this for yourselves?

17
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,440
Just comment a website down below,

18
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,760
and I'll send you guys the links directly.
